{
  "name": "TriagePilot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TriagePilot (hybrid: n8n + FastAPI)\nn8n orchestrates; the rule engine, guardrails and audit live in a FastAPI service. Urgency and routing are never decided by the model.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "tp-note-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1 \u00b7 Intake & validation\nShared secret checked, required fields checked.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "tp-note-1",
      "name": "Note - Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2 \u00b7 Triage (FastAPI)\nModel extracts signals only. A 14 rule catalog decides urgency, topic and route. Model then drafts a reply, checked by a narration guardrail.\nPOST {api_base_url}/triage",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "tp-note-2",
      "name": "Note - Triage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 \u00b7 Route by outcome + human decides\nEach outcome has its own review lane. A person approves, edits or rejects, never an automatic send.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "tp-note-3",
      "name": "Note - Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1344,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4 \u00b7 Approval\nSecond trigger, same workflow. A human's decision is recorded to the audit trail in FastAPI.\nPOST {api_base_url}/human/{ticket_id}",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "tp-note-4",
      "name": "Note - Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        1024
      ]
